{
  "name": "Your Seller and Agent Outbound System",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - TWO LISTS, ONE PIPE\n\nFresh distressed-owner records and agents sitting on aged or off-market listings get pulled on the same schedule, then merged into one queue with a seller or agent tag. Two campaigns, one system, nobody uploads a CSV.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d54828a8-ab2d-5ff4-a258-ebc5b4310b3f",
      "name": "Section - 1 - TWO LISTS, ONE PIPE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - CLEAN BEFORE ANYTHING SENDS\n\nEvery address is verified, bounces and catch-alls are suppressed instead of sent, and anyone already contacted or opted out is filtered out. This is what keeps the sending domains alive.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fd534449-af7f-5374-afbe-b62f0f602ab5",
      "name": "Section - 2 - CLEAN BEFORE ANYTHING SENDS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - WRITE THE HUMAN VERSION\n\nClaude reads the actual property record or listing and writes the plain-text first line off what it found, picks the angle, then the lead drops into the seller or the agent sequence.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "3f48206e-c6bc-5f1b-b3de-68bbf993a866",
      "name": "Section - 3 - WRITE THE HUMAN VERSION",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - REPLIES INTO YOUR CRM\n\nEvery reply is read and sorted within minutes. Interested goes straight to the CRM with acquisitions alerted, questions go to a human, not now goes to nurture, remove is suppressed everywhere.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1040,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "29ff0c37-1efe-52ba-8716-93ba4c40fcd2",
      "name": "Section - 4 - REPLIES INTO YOUR CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3500,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - NUMBERS AND NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY\n\nOne scorecard row a day with sent, bounce, reply, positive and appointments, so scaling is a decision off real numbers. If any step fails you get told which node and which record.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "9eec8b73-3d60-55d7-af79-01d066505a3a",
      "name": "Section - 5 - NUMBERS AND NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
